request: Add a button that clears every movie whose `seen` flag is true from the watchlist.

governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  (The request's "seen" flag maps to the existing `watched` boolean on WatchItem. Plan: teach the store to bulk-remove watched items (new `clearWatched()` returning the removed count), then surface a "Clear watched" button on the watchlist view that calls it, rendered disabled when nothing is watched. Acceptance tests pin the store semantics and the button wiring.)
round 1: owners watchlist-store=ok watchlist=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 2: accept  (All units implemented as planned; tsc passes and all 41 tests (including acceptance tests for WatchlistStore.clearWatched and the Watchlist "Clear watched" button) pass green.)

